Package: diann.gui
Type: Package
Title: Web GUI for Submitting and Monitoring DIA-NN Jobs on Slurm Clusters or Linux Workstations
Version: 1.14.0
Authors@R: person("Zhang Dong", email = "zhangdong_0121@foxmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny dashboard that puts DIA-NN behind a browser: build commands,
    submit them as Slurm batch jobs or run them locally on the GUI host, always
    through the official DIA-NN container image (Apptainer .sif), and monitor
    queues, logs and results. Supports per-user self-hosted runs and command
    import from pasted DIA-NN command lines.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    shiny,
    shinydashboard,
    shinyFiles,
    htmltools,
    httpuv,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/zhangdong360/diann-gui
BugReports: https://github.com/zhangdong360/diann-gui/issues
RoxygenNote: none
